{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/929549-is-there-a-set-age-for-first-change","id":929549,"title":"is there a set age for first change?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-10T21:45:33-07:00","id":929549,"title":"is there a set age for first change?","content":"Can it happen to children?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","name":"Seta143","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T22:28:59-07:00","id":929561,"title":"","content":"It happens around/after adolescence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T22:35:19-07:00","id":929563,"title":"","content":"It can happen at any time, it most often happens to young adults.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2313-knit-i-fine","name":"Knit-I-Fine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T18:21:34-07:00","id":930073,"title":"","content":"In theory, any age. Nobody knows what causes it or why it happens when it does, except that all wolf-blooded have the potential. On the other hand, it doesn't seem to happen to pre-pubescent cubs. Out-of-character, because it would be dumb. In-character, maybe the amped-up hormones jump-start whatever it is that brings the wolf to the fore.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag","name":"Black Flag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar352_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T18:32:51-07:00","id":930084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Flag</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/929549-is-there-a-set-age-for-first-change?p=930073#post930073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> In-character, maybe the amped-up hormones jump-start whatever it is that brings the wolf to the fore.</div> </div> </div> </div>In character is because the organism already went thru a change of sort.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T19:18:50-07:00","id":930113,"title":"","content":"From Night Horrors: Wolfsbane, p53:<br /> <br /> 'Most among the People experience the First Change sometime after puberty and sometime before the infirmity of old age sets in. Generally, that\u2019s for the best. Children can\u2019t handle the mental and emotional trauma of becoming a moon-mad, half-spirit beast, and even a werewolf\u2019s legendary physical vigor can only do so much with a body ravaged by a lifetime of human frailty. By choosing those in their physical and emotional prime, Mother Luna ensures that her children are capable of performing the job set before them.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, any Elodoth who has tried to negotiate with a Lune can tell you that Mother Luna is a certifiably insane bitch goddess, and her spirit-children are no different. Sometimes, whether by whim or unknowable divine plan or sheer madness, Luna reaches down to \u201cbless\u201d a nuzusul far younger than the norm. Mark Lee was the unfortunate result of one such whim. Three weeks after his 10th birthday, Mark began complaining to his parents that monsters were lurking outside his window at night.'<br /> <br /> Unfortunately Marks time as a werewolf was a troubled one most adult werewolves wouldn't survive, as evidenced by the death of his adult pack.<br /> <br /> So any age is fair game, though at the extreme ends it's more rare. Limiting it for gaming purposes is a reasonable decision. It could still be good for story hooks, even if you don't allow it to be played.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 07-11-2016, 10:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T23:28:24-07:00","id":930201,"title":"","content":"Also, As a reminder, you can be wolfblooded from birth, and some wolfblood Tells simulate the werewolf condition in particular ways, so if you'd like you can always tell that story even having to test the limits of the First Change story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T08:16:27-07:00","id":930348,"title":"","content":"Well my friend wants to run an innocents campaign in a couple weeks, i only ask because another person in our group usually likes to go werewolf and just in case i'd like to know ahead of time if it comes up which it might not but either way it's good to know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","name":"Seta143","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T08:36:15-07:00","id":930360,"title":"","content":"Obviously a player becoming a werewolf in an otherwise mortal story is going to quickly shift all attention to the character who is suddenly a combat beast that can heal nearly any wound and has senses better than a whole group of mortals put together. You might just limit it to wolf-blooded.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-12T10:18:15-07:00","id":930402,"title":"","content":"i have no say in the matter. That's up to our story teller, but if he allows my friend to be a werewolf then someone else is probably going to opt for mage. Then again neither one of them might not say anything at all and we could end up being just plain mortals anyway","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","name":"Seta143","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-13T21:14:26-07:00","id":931174,"title":"","content":"I'm just gonna recommend the graphic novel <a href=\"http://www.monsterelementary.com/home\" target=\"_blank\">Monster elementary</a>, which is mandatory reading for an ST running a group of monstrous Innocents.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-19T20:27:07-07:00","id":934257,"title":"","content":"Something like happening to children would be a great plot story that I would like to see, but I would like to see an original idea for why something like that would be triggered on a child too. As for myself, I would prefer to make it happens around adolescence. Simply put, the hormonal change, Identity crisis, Physical transformation, and psychological stress caused by many of the sociological paradox like the fact that you want to be yourself, your own man, to be able to stand out of the mass, but at the same time, to become who you are you explore that said mass, to conform yourself to it, to avoid being rejected and to be &quot;in&quot;, are the perfect mixt, in my eyes, of factors and age, that would provoke the first change. In the ends, its up to you. <br /> Ask yourself: Does your idea fits with the general idea of the book ? If not, can you put some sort of logic to it ? Is it entertaining ? Is it original ? Is it fun ? In the end, the plot/story factor, surprise, and fun that all of you share together are more important than the rest.<br /> <br /> Have fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2986-warriorshaman","name":"Warriorshaman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-25T14:55:08-07:00","id":937308,"title":"","content":"Everyone just went with normal mortal children thankfully it never became an issue.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","name":"Seta143","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}